{"id":"wb-7-948","name":"甲辰巷砖塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"甲辰巷砖塔","text":"甲辰巷砖塔位于中国江苏省苏州市姑苏区相门内干将东路甲辰巷南首，为五层八面的楼阁式塔，采用青砖仿木结构，高6.82米，底边宽0.51米。各层均以相间的菱角牙子和板檐砖叠涩挑出腰檐，檐下壁面隐出阑额、柱头枋与转角铺作，檐上架设平座，八面间隔辟壶门和隐出直棂窗，四门四窗的位置逐层相错。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%94%B2%E8%BE%B0%E5%B7%B7%E7%A0%96%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86954398,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86954398","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/974a7eba444341fdad86f34c.jpg","title":"Jiachen_Alley_Pagoda_2023_1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jiachen_Alley_Pagoda_2023_1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/27/Jiachen_Alley_Pagoda_2023_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Simon Tsu","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","caption":"front view of the pagoda, showing a mini garden and glass barriers around the pagoda","width":320,"height":425}}